  "sections": [
    {
      "seq": 1, "syllabusRowSeq": 1, "kind": "WRITTEN",
      "instructionBn": "Read the passage carefully and write the meanings of the words.",
      "count": 3, "marksEach": 1, "total": 3,
      "choiceNoteBn": null, "splitMarks": false,
      "stimulusMd": "**The boys and the frogs**\n\nThere is a pond in a village. Some boys are passing by the pond. They look at the frogs in the pond and stop there. Some frogs are playing in the water. The boys find some stones near the road. Taking the stones, they begin to throw them at the frogs. They are laughing and clapping. But their cruel play kills one of the frogs. The other frogs shout against the killing. A brave frog raises its head and cries out, \"Stop! Stop!\" The boys say, \"We are just playing.\" The frog says, \"Look at the dead frog. What is play to you is death to us.\" The boys become very sad. They say, \"Sorry, dear Frog. We will never do it again.\"",
      "matchRight": null,
      "items": [
        { "key": "s1-1", "text": "Brave", "answer": "সাহসী", "marks": 1, "source": "MP2026", "sourceRef": "মোহাম্মদপুর বার্ষিক ২০২৬ · প্রশ্ন ৪", "bookRef": "Unit 10, p.97", "needsPicture": false, "note": null },
        { "key": "s1-2", "text": "Against", "answer": "বিরুদ্ধে", "marks": 1, "source": "MP2026", "sourceRef": "মোহাম্মদপুর বার্ষিক ২০২৬ · প্রশ্ন ৪", "bookRef": "Unit 10, p.96", "needsPicture": false, "note": null },
        { "key": "s1-3", "text": "Death", "answer": "মৃত্যু", "marks": 1, "source": "MP2026", "sourceRef": "মোহাম্মদপুর বার্ষিক ২০২৬ · প্রশ্ন ৪", "bookRef": "Unit 10, p.97", "needsPicture": false, "note": null }
      ]
    },
    {
      "seq": 2, "syllabusRowSeq": 2, "kind": "WRITTEN",
